{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RnGesus Slayer: It's Slay the Spire meets slot machine! <br><br><strong>RnGesus Slayer</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you have <strong>3 separate decks</strong> and cards are dealt by <strong>spinning a slot machine</strong>! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/1.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards with <strong>similar type</strong> when land will <strong>combo</strong> together to create an <strong>upgraded version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/2.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>weapons cards</strong> to attack the minions of the godess, <strong>magic cards</strong> to gain mana to use spells, and<strong> gold cards</strong> to buy upgrades to your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/3.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of <strong>unique spells</strong> to kill the enemies, upgrade your hands/decks or rig the slot-machine to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/4.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique spell and power system, with over 35+ spells, 15+ powers and 45+ enemies to fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/5.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>Free demo</strong> now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/6.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3007890?t=1744664727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3007890?t=1744664727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/037b75f294f90267d6f6d98d94bbc76f47508cc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744664727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/037b75f294f90267d6f6d98d94bbc76f47508cc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744664727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3031290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RnGesus Slayer: It's Slay the Spire meets slot machine! <br><br><strong>RnGesus Slayer</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you have <strong>3 separate decks</strong> and cards are dealt by <strong>spinning a slot machine</strong>! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/1.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards with <strong>similar type</strong> when land will <strong>combo</strong> together to create an <strong>upgraded version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007890/extras/2.gif?t=1744664727\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>weapons cards</strong> to attack the minions of the godess, <strong>magic cards</strong> to gain mana to use spells, and<strong> gold cards</strong> to buy upgrades to your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3